## Processor System

### BaseProcessor (abstract)

- `def: ProcessorDef` — type, title, category, input/output handles, defaultParams.
- `execute(inputs, params, engine) → Record<string, any>`.
- `alwaysDirty: boolean` — engine marks dirty every frame.
- RT pool: `ensureRT(w, h)`, `ensurePing(w, h)`, `ensurePong(w, h)`.
- `val(inputs, params, key, fallback)` — priority: connected input > param > fallback.
- `resolveRes(inputs, params, engine)` — explicit width/height > `source` texture > `sdf`/`coords_tex` > any texture > engine defaults (900x1200).

### Slot Types

`TEXTURE`, `NUMBER`, `VEC`, `CONFIG`, `CONTOUR`, `EVENT`, `SIGNAL`, `ANIMATION`, `METRICS`, `TEXT`, `TEXT_STYLE`, `ANY`. Connection validation in `node-editor/constants.ts → SLOT_COMPAT`. `TEXT_STYLE` distinct from `CONFIG` so a typography preset can't be wired into an effect's `config`. There's no `POLYGON` slot — geometry flows as `CONTOUR` (`ContourSamples` SoA) end-to-end.

### Signal Types

- `EventSignal` — discrete: `{ count, lastTimestampMs, lastX?, lastY? }`.
- `Signal` — continuous from Timer / Interpolator / Envelope / Combine: `{ value, time, age, state, lastTimestampMs }`. Consumers read `.value`, never `.time` (time keeps growing through paused intervals — see `animation-system.mdc`).
- `ChannelSignal` — emitted by AnimationController per channel: `{ time, raw, value, state }`. Note: `time` here carries upstream `Signal.value` (unclamped), NOT `Signal.time`.
- `AnimationSignal` — `{ channels: Record<string, ChannelSignal> }`.
- `EffectMetrics` — `{ effectName, totalMs, cpuMs, gpuDispatchMs, passes: PassMetric[], timestampMs }`.

### Processor Catalog (29 types)

**Input** (6): `number`, `constantSignal`, `image`, `text`, `textStyle`, `textStrip`
**Image ops** (4): `blur`, `remap`, `blend`, `denoise`
**Contour** (3): `segmentation`, `contourResample`, `sdfFromContour`
**Animation triggers** (3): `eventEmitter`, `tapZone`, `timer`
**Animation modulators** (4): `envelope`, `interpolator`, `combineSignals`, `signalSwitch`
**Animation controllers** (2): `animationController`, `animationSwitch`
**Output** (4): `effect`, `preview`, `contourPreview`, `publishRoot`
**Utility** (3): `config`, `noiseVisualizer`, `log`

**`alwaysDirty` processors**: `effect`, `eventEmitter`, `tapZone`, `timer`, `envelope`, `combineSignals`, `signalSwitch`, `animationController`, `animationSwitch`. `interpolator` is intentionally NOT alwaysDirty (pure function of input). `log` rides upstream Effect's dirty propagation. `publishRoot` is a pass-through that rides upstream Effect.

See `processors-catalogue.mdc` for per-processor reference. The depth-estimation (`depthEstimate`, `depthBlit`) and AI material/normals (`materialEstimate`, `marigoldDepth`, `marigoldNormals`) processors used to ship but were removed; their category strings (`depth`, `ai`, `marigold`, `dnf`, `source`, `process`) are still tolerated for snapshot back-compat.

#### Text composition

`text` (TEXT) + `textStyle` (TEXT_STYLE) → `textStrip` (texture). See `text-composition.mdc`. Old `sdfTextAtlas` was removed (no live consumer).

#### Geometry composition

`segmentation` emits `contour: CONTOUR` directly (full `ContourSamples` packet). `contourResample` and `sdfFromContour` chain off it. Legacy `polygon` processor + dead `coords_tex` / `aabb` / `point_count` / `tex_dim` reads were removed. See `geometry-contour.mdc`.

#### Animation composition (Timer + Interpolator)

`autoTimer` was decomposed into `timer` (pure clock — `looped` saw or `unbounded` linear, with `paused` toggle) + `interpolator` (shape-only — `linear / sine / triangle / bell / gaussian / pulse` plus discrete `steps / square / sawTeeth`). Minimal animation graph: `Timer → AnimationController → Effect`. Insert `Interpolator` for shaped waveform; omit for raw monotonic phase. Old `autoTimer` snapshots log `Unknown processor type: autoTimer` and skip — no auto-migration.

