## Effect System

### PlaygroundConfig (manifest)

`name`, `canvas`, `fields` (user-tunable uniforms), optional `staticUniforms`, ordered `passes[]`, `animation.slots[]` (which animation pool indices the effect consumes — UI labels + default min/max).

### Animation Channels (universal pool)

`ANIMATION_CHANNEL_COUNT = 8`. Effects pick **indices**. Shaders bind `vec4 uChan{i}`:

| Component | Source | Notes |
|-----------|--------|-------|
| `.x` (drive) | upstream `Signal.value` (unclamped) | Timer `unbounded` grows linearly; Interpolator profiles oscillate 0..1; paused Timer holds. NOT `Signal.time` ms. |
| `.y` (raw) | `clamp01(Signal.value)` | Bounded 0..1 mix factor. |
| `.z` (value) | `lerp(min, max, .y)` | Physical value via controller's per-slot `min_i`/`max_i`. |
| `.w` (state) | upstream `Signal.state` | 0 idle / 1 clip in progress. |

Canonical slot layout (convention only):

| Slot | Role |
|------|------|
| 0    | primary phase (scroll / progress) |
| 1    | radial offset / phase |
| 2    | width / size |
| 3    | spacing / glow |
| 4    | intensity (alpha multiplier) |
| 5    | noise time driver |
| 6, 7 | free |

`EffectProcessor` warns once per (effect, slot) when a shader references an undeclared `uChan{i}`.

**Speed is upstream, period.** No effect manifest exposes `uOrbitSpeed`, `uRaySpeed`, `uWaveSpeed`, `uNoiseSpeed`, `uSlideSpeed`, `uColorSpeed`, etc. Animation rate fully owned by `Timer (mode + durationMs) → optional Interpolator/Envelope/Combine → AnimationController (min/max)`. To pause: `Timer.paused = true`. To slow/speed: tune `durationMs`. To rescale amplitude: tune controller `min_i`/`max_i`.

### Pass Types

- **Fullscreen** — fragment shader to fullscreen quad. Optional `requiresInputs`.
- **Instanced** — vertex + fragment with per-instance geometry from contour. Optional `scrolling: { mode: 'glyph' | 'ribbon', spacingField | segmentSizeField, phraseLenField?, repeatsField?, phaseSlot? }`.

### Runtime (EffectProcessor)

Resolves active effect from `config.__effectName`, builds `UniformGroup` from fields + static uniforms + the full 8-channel animation pool + the full 8-slot texture pool (`uTxcn0..uTxcn7`, with 1×1 white fallback for unconnected slots referenced by the shader). Passes execute in order into a single output RT. `Shader.from` with WebGL2 GLSL.

### Available Effects (8)

`ping-pong-morphing` (single wave), `god-rays` (single ray), `light-beam` (single ray), `dot-orbit`, `dot-grid-orbit`, `text-orbit`, `text-grid-orbit`, `marching-ants`. Multi-instance compositions built by **chaining Effect nodes** through `source` with `blend: 'add'`. Shaders themselves render exactly one instance.

### Texture Channels (universal pool)

`TEXTURE_CHANNEL_COUNT = 8`. Each manifest declares which slots it consumes via `PlaygroundConfig.textures.slots` with a UI label. Shaders bind only declared channels via `uniform sampler2D uTxcn{i};`. Unconnected `txcn{i}` referenced by a shader → 1×1 white fallback.

### Noise Standard

Canonical primitives in `pipeline/noise.glsl.ts` (`hash21`, `valueNoise2D`, `fbm2D`). Time-driven noise reads from slot 5: `fbm2D(uv * uScale + uChan5.x * driftDir)`.

### Noise Visualizer

Debug surface: chess / stripes pattern warped by two decorrelated `fbm2D` samples. Drift driver = `signal.value`, NOT `signal.time` — paused Timer freezes the field, `unbounded` drifts steadily, Interpolator `sine` breathes.

### Effect Profiling (`log`)

`EffectProcessor.execute()` records per-pass CPU build time + single GPU dispatch around `renderer.render()`. Per-pass GPU timing isn't split (whole stage flushes through one batched draw — true split needs `EXT_disjoint_timer_query`, unevenly supported). `log` consumes `metrics: METRICS`, stores raw + EMA-smoothed (`smoothing` param, default 0.85). View shows `total / cpu / gpu dispatch / fps cap` + per-pass list with id, kind tag, `cpuMs`, bar proportional to heaviest pass. Skipped passes shown without bar. React commits throttled to 100 ms.

