## Conventions

- **Engine ↔ UI separation**: Processors are pure engine-side (`node-engine/`); views are pure UI-side (`flow-nodes/views/`). Communicate only through `EngineContext` + `useNodeOutputs` / `useSetParam`.
- **No CSS modules**: Plain `.css` files with class-based scoping (`.pn`, `.pn-header`, etc.).
- **Grid alignment**: All node dimensions, positions, handle ports snap to 20 px grid. Handle row pitch = grid step so ports always land on grid dots.
- **Snapshot-based undo/redo**: Debounced (1200 ms) full-scene serialisation to Dexie. Max 80 snapshots.
- **Barrel re-exports**: `widgets/index.ts` and `node-editor/constants.ts`.
- **Dense MUI**: 6 px spacing, 28 px button height, 24 px input height. Monospace typography throughout.
- **ESM-only**: `"type": "module"` in package.json, no CommonJS `require()`.
